<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?> <?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="rss.xsl"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"> <channel> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title><description>SONiC NOS（sonic-net/SONiC）の日本語非公式ドキュメント</description><link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link><atom:link href="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml" /> <docs>https://github.com/aoki-taquan/sonic-unofficial-docs</docs><language>ja</language> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:47:54 -0000</pubDate> <lastBuildDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:47:54 -0000</lastBuildDate> <ttl>1440</ttl> <generator>MkDocs RSS plugin - v1.19.0</generator> <image> <url>None</url> <title>SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</title> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/</link> </image> <item> <title>ACL &amp; QoS</title> <description>ACL &amp; QoS — ACL、CoPP、mirror、buffer、PFC、watermark、scheduler などパケット制御と QoS を扱う章。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/index.png" type="image/png" length="32472" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL の egress mirror 対応と SAI ベース action capability 問い合わせ</title> <description>ACL の egress mirror 対応と SAI ベース action capability 問い合わせ — ACL は ASIC ごとに ingress / egress stage で使えるアクションが異なる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/egress-mirroring-support-and-acl-action-capability-check/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/egress-mirroring-support-and-acl-action-capability-check/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/egress-mirroring-support-and-acl-action-capability-check.png" type="image/png" length="55428" /> </item> <item> <title>QoS Scheduler / Shaper（SP / WRR / DWRR + min/max bandwidth）</title> <description>QoS Scheduler / Shaper（SP / WRR / DWRR + min/max bandwidth） — SONiC の QoS には scheduling と shaping の 2 軸がある:</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/sonic-qos-scheduler-and-shaping.png" type="image/png" length="63902" /> </item> <item> <title>WRED / ECN 統計（per-queue / per-port、capability ベース）</title> <description>WRED / ECN 統計（per-queue / per-port、capability ベース） — SAI が出す WRED ドロップ / ECN マーク専用カウンタを Flex Counter で COUNTERS_DB に出し、show queue wredcounters および show interfa…</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/wred-and-ecn-statistics/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/acl-qos/wred-and-ecn-statistics/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/acl-qos/wred-and-ecn-statistics.png" type="image/png" length="42591" /> </item> <item> <title>ビルドプロファイル（rules/profiles/*.mk）</title> <description>ビルドプロファイル（rules/profiles/*.mk） — SONiC のビルドは多数のビルドフラグ（ENABLE_ZTP, SECURE_UPGRADE_*, USERNAME, PASSWORD, CHANGE_DEFAULT_PASSWORD 等）の組み合わせで挙動が変わる。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-profiles/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-profiles/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-profiles.png" type="image/png" length="35098" /> </item> <item> <title>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離）</title> <description>ビルド時間最適化（Dockerfile レイヤ削減 / BuildKit / 並列 dh / sairedis 分離） — 本 HLD は主に第 2 段階に焦点を当て、4 つの最適化を提案する:</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/build-system-improvements/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/build-system-improvements.png" type="image/png" length="46022" /> </item> <item> <title>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト</title> <description>DIP=SIP PTF 検証テスト — 「DIP（destination IP）と SIP（source IP）が同じ」L3 パケットを SONiC スイッチが正しくルーティングできるかを PTF (Packet Test Framework) で検証 するテストの設計。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/dip-sip-ptf-validation-high-level-design.png" type="image/png" length="30488" /> </item> <item> <title>GNS3 VM 上での SONiC 動作（sonic-vs.img と Qemu テンプレート）</title> <description>GNS3 VM 上での SONiC 動作（sonic-vs.img と Qemu テンプレート） — GNS3 はネットワーク機器をエミュレートして簡易トポロジを Windows 上または Ubuntu サーバ上で実行できるツールである。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-on-gns3-vm/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/sonic-on-gns3-vm/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/sonic-on-gns3-vm.png" type="image/png" length="57972" /> </item> <item> <title>SONiC-VS のビルドと libvirt 起動手順</title> <description>SONiC-VS のビルドと libvirt 起動手順 — SONiC-VS（Virtual Switch）は ASIC を SAI VS バックエンドで模した仮想イメージで、KVM/libvirt 上で起動して機能テストやトポロジ実験に使う。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/steps-to-bring-up-sonic-vs/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/architecture/steps-to-bring-up-sonic-vs/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/architecture/steps-to-bring-up-sonic-vs.png" type="image/png" length="37038" /> </item> <item> <title>評価者向けガイド</title> <description>評価者向けガイド — ラボで SONiC を試用する読者を想定しています。仮想環境または評価機で起動し、管理 IP、ポート、VLAN、BGP などの基本設定を入れ、状態確認まで一連の流れを辿るための導線です。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/evaluator/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/guides/evaluator/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/guides/evaluator.png" type="image/png" length="17743" /> </item> <item> <title>ZMQ ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable 設計</title> <description>ZMQ ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable 設計 — 通常の ProducerStateTable / ConsumerStateTable は Redis 経由でメッセージを運ぶ。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/internals/zmq-producer-consumer-state-table-design.png" type="image/png" length="42995" /> </item> <item> <title>YANG モデルによる ConfigDB 更新検証（GCU + ConfigDBConnector デコレータ）</title> <description>YANG モデルによる ConfigDB 更新検証（GCU + ConfigDBConnector デコレータ） — SONiC では従来、config 系 CLI が ConfigDB に書き込む前のフィールド検証を Python のハードコード（ad-hoc）と YANG モデルの両方 で重複定義していた。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-config-update-validation-via-yang/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/management/sonic-config-update-validation-via-yang/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/management/sonic-config-update-validation-via-yang.png" type="image/png" length="46242" /> </item> <item> <title>VLAN Subnet Decap（Netscan 用 IPinIP MP2MP デカプスル）</title> <description>VLAN Subnet Decap（Netscan 用 IPinIP MP2MP デカプスル） — Azure Netscan は IPinIP プローブ（outer DIP=デバイス Loopback、inner DIP=Netscan 送信元）でネットワーク経路の blackhole を検知する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/subnet-decapsulation-with-sonic/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/platform/subnet-decapsulation-with-sonic/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/platform/subnet-decapsulation-with-sonic.png" type="image/png" length="51861" /> </item> <item> <title>用語集 (Glossary)</title> <description>用語集 (Glossary) — SONiC NOS で頻出する固有用語・略語・コンポーネント名・データベース名・デーモン名を、アルファベット順に整理した日本語用語集です。各エントリは「用語 / 略称 / 日本語訳 / 簡潔な説明 / 関連ページ」の形式で記載しています。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/glossary/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/glossary.png" type="image/png" length="30026" /> </item> <item> <title>頻出 SAI 属性早見表</title> <description>頻出 SAI 属性早見表 — SONiC syncd は SAI (Switch Abstraction Interface) を介して ASIC に設定を投入する。本ページは</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/sai-attributes/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/sai-attributes/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/sai-attributes.png" type="image/png" length="26792" /> </item> <item> <title>show queue サブコマンド</title> <description>show queue サブコマンド — show queue は queue counter、WRED counter、queue watermark を表示する CLI グループ。counter は queuestat / wredstat、watermark は watermarkstat へ委譲する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-queue/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/cli/show-queue/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/cli/show-queue.png" type="image/png" length="32692" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL_TABLE_TYPE テーブル</title> <description>ACL_TABLE_TYPE テーブル — ユーザ定義 ACL テーブルタイプ（カスタム match フィールド / action / バインドポイント）を定義する CONFIG_DB テーブル。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table-type/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/acl-table-type/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/acl-table-type.png" type="image/png" length="28072" /> </item> <item> <title>ACL orchagent STATE_DB テーブル</title> <description>STATE_DB の ACL 関連テーブル — AclOrch が SAI ACL 操作後に書き込む ACL_TABLE_TABLE / ACL_RULE_TABLE / ACL_STAGE_CAPABILITY_TABLE の構造とフィールド詳細。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/aclorch-state/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/aclorch-state/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/aclorch-state.png" type="image/png" length="41089" /> </item> <item> <title>ALARM テーブル (EVENT_DB)</title> <description>ALARM テーブル — SONiC Event/Alarm Framework が STATE_DB (EVENT_DB) に保持するアクティブアラーム一覧テーブル。eventd が書き込み、gNMI/REST/CLI が参照する。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/alarm-table/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/alarm-table/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/alarm-table.png" type="image/png" length="39352" /> </item> <item> <title>アプリケーション フローカウンタ設定</title> <description>CONFIG_DB FLOW_COUNTER_ROUTE_PATTERN / FLEX_COUNTER_TABLE FLOW_CNT_TRAP|FLOW_CNT_ROUTE — route flow counter と trap flow counter の有効化・パターン設定・ポーリング間隔のコード由来デフォルト解説。</description> <link>https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/app-counter/</link> <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 03:45:53 +0000</pubDate> <source url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/feed_rss_updated.xml">SONiC 非公式ドキュメント</source><guid isPermaLink="true">https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/reference/config-db/app-counter/</guid> <enclosure url="https://aoki-taquan.github.io/sonic-unofficial-docs/assets/images/social/reference/config-db/app-counter.png" type="image/png" length="27039" /> </item> </channel> </rss>